                                "sense_id": "78ee010d-d03d-3e1a-a1ab-3e2050b52d8f",
                                "text": "Das schaut ihm ähnlich, dass er abhaut, ohne was zu sagen.",
                                "translation": "It's typical of him to piss off without saying anything.",
